    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your dream job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an intern at a company where the bosses are demons, the coworkers are suspiciously silent, and KPIs are measured not in money but in surviving employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today\u2019s duties:<br>\u2714 Prepare the office for the next working day.<br>\u2714 Ascend to the next floor.<br>\u2714 Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probation period\u202f\u2014\u202f9 floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.<br>The higher you climb, the more\u2026 interesting the work becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the instructions. Don\u2019t ask unnecessary questions.<br>And remember: a bad employee is a dead employee.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your dream job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an intern at a company where the bosses are demons, the coworkers are suspiciously silent, and KPIs are measured not in money but in surviving employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today\u2019s duties:<br>\u2714 Prepare the office for the next working day.<br>\u2714 Ascend to the next floor.<br>\u2714 Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probation period\u202f\u2014\u202f9 floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.<br>The higher you climb, the more\u2026 interesting the work becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the instructions. Don\u2019t ask unnecessary questions.<br>And remember: a bad employee is a dead employee.</p>",
